# BusyBox init's table (MyNook replaces Buildroot's own).
#
#   sysinit    once, at start-up
#   respawn    started, and started again if it ever exits
#   shutdown   on the way down (power off or restart)
#
# The reader asks for power off with SIGUSR2 to init and for a restart
# with SIGTERM (reader/platform_fb.c).
::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS
::respawn:/usr/bin/mynook-session
::shutdown:/etc/init.d/stop
